{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:100640","published":"2026-11-21T06:05:33.360400Z","modified":"2026-11-21T06:30:03.082482348Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-111943","CVE-2026-78667","CVE-2026-97031"],"summary":"Important: skopeo security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The skopeo command lets you inspect images from container image registries, get images and image layers, and use signatures to create and verify files. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* net/http: golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n\n* crypto/tls: golang: crypto/tls: Denial of Service via multiple ECH outer extension references (CVE-2026-97031)\n\n* crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Drop libtrust_openssl build tag for golang-1.27 compatibility [rhel-9.9.z] (JIRA:Rocky Linux-299628)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"skopeo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/skopeo?distro=rocky-linux-9&epoch=3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:1.22.2-6.el9_9"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:100640.json"}},{"package":{"name":"skopeo-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/skopeo-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-9&epoch=3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:1.22.2-6.el9_9"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:100640.json"}},{"package":{"name":"skopeo-debugsource","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/skopeo-debugso